content:
Evidence from the datasheet: receiver sensitivity is defined in two rows (125 Mbaud / −26 dBm and 250 Mbaud / −22 dBm). Power (150 mW typ / 200 mW max) is module-wide, not per rate. Reach (50 m NA 0.5 vs 70 m NA 0.3) is not tied to those sensitivity rows, so pairing reach to a rate would be speculative—0.05 km is only assigned where Fast Ethernet + 0.5 NA POF is the stated application context.

